MEET THE MAKER.

Introducing Sam Rivera, a ceramics artist balancing craft with patience.

For Sam, making is about showing up and finding more in the process.

[Watch the story ➔](https://click.shop.example.com/REDACTED)

Sam

Sam's journey began in a small garage workshop. What started as a weekend hobby quickly became something much bigger: a passion for clay, patience and community.

From a first lopsided mug to a full studio collection, Sam learned that progress is slow and worth it.

